msgctxt "136"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "You're coming with me. Deal with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I heard you murdered your friends. Why would you do\r\n"
"something like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "It wasn't me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "208"
msgid "I didn't kill 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"This guy I never met attacked us out of nowhere! He\r\n"
"killed off all my friends, one by one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "So someone else is the real killer, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"I barely escaped with my life. That guy laughed the\r\n"
"whole time he was killing 'em!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "I haven't been able to stop laughing ever since."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"On top of it all, my family thought I killed 'em, so they\r\n"
"kicked me out. I didn't have anywhere to go..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Is that so..."
msgstr "È così, eh..."

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"You probably don't believe me, but⑬ Hey, wait a minute.\r\n"
"I stopped laughing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Yeah. I guess you did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"That's weird. My head feels clearer now, too. Even after\r\n"
"that bashing. Crazy, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "I dunno why, but I feel tired all of a sudden..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Why don't you go visit the Honest Living Association now?\r\n"
"You can rest there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Yeah, okay. I'll do that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Bwehehe..."
msgstr "Gheh gheh gheh..."

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Bwehehe... Hehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Hey there. Are you Kengo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Bwehehe..."
msgstr "Gheh gheh gheh..."

msgctxt "460"
msgid "I asked you a question. You're the Reaper Kengo, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "That's right... Bwehehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "We've got some questions for you. You're coming with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Questions about the Reapers? I ain't talkin'. Bwehehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "I'll drag you there if I have to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Bwehehe... Drag me? You think you can catch me, do ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "544"
msgid "You're gonna catch me... I'm gonna get caught...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Yaaaaaaaaaaaaah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Bweh heh. Stay back... Stay back, I tell ya!"
msgstr ""

